  "name": "Application Mapping: DIO/ODI Commit-Boundary Contract × Policy-as-Code Authorization",
  "description": "A derived application mapping from DIO/ODI-informed commit-boundary authorization obligations to Policy-as-Code mechanisms and integration requirements, using OPA/Rego and Cedar as technical reference points. It does not claim native implementation or semantic equivalence.",
